// Sounio Theorem Standard Library
//
// Proof and theorem-proving standard library for Sounio.
// Unlike Lean/Coq, proofs here carry uncertainty confidence.
//
// Modules:
//   kernel    - Core proof kernel (Prop, Proof, natural deduction)
//   logic     - Propositional and first-order logic
//   nat       - Peano natural numbers with induction
//   tactics   - Tactic framework for proof automation
//   real      - Real number properties and inequalities
//   units     - Dimensional analysis as theorem proving
//   epistemic - Epistemic proof theory (NOVEL — unique to Sounio)
//
// The epistemic module is the crown jewel: proofs about and under
// uncertainty, GUM propagation proofs, Dempster-Shafer combination
// proofs, temporal decay bounds, and sensor fusion optimality.

// Import submodules directly:
//   use theorem::kernel::*;
//   use theorem::logic::*;
//   use theorem::nat::*;
//   use theorem::tactics::*;
//   use theorem::real::*;
//   use theorem::units::*;
//   use theorem::epistemic::*;
